Package: osintgram
Version: 2.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Alienkrishn [Anon4You]
Depends: curl, tar, python, python-pip, build-essential, rust, file
Section: social
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/Datalux/Osintgram
Description: OSINT tool for Instagram account analysis
 Osintgram collects and lays out everything a public Instagram
 profile gives away in a local web interface. Ask in plain
 language with a local AI model or drive the lookups yourself.
